The readline click in readline.rs: boundary(), the column a click names, is
xterm's eventColBetween formula, and point_move(), the cursor keys it sends,
is ReadLineMovePoint's count over rowOnCurrentLine's wrapped rows (button.c,
xterm patch #411), re-expressed; xterm's documentation gives neither. The
paste's body() and quoted() follow the documented ctlseqs text, not this
code
